OL,3,ASri Lankan court to deliver verdict on
OL,4,Adeadly Easter bombings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sri Lankan court is set to rule on
OL,7,FNaufer Moulavi, who is accused of
OL,8,Fmasterminding the Easter bomb attacks
OL,9,Fthat killed 270 people and injured more
OL,10,Fthan 500 in 2019.
OL,12,FTwenty-three others will also receive
OL,13,Fverdicts for their involvement in
OL,14,Fplanning and carrying out the
OL,15,Fco-ordinated suicide bombings.
OL,17,FThe attacks on several locations
OL,18,Fincluding several churches holding
OL,19,FEaster mass and three luxury hotels was
OL,20,Fthe deadliest attack Sri Lanka had seen
OL,21,Fsince the end of its civil war in 2009.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
