OL,3,ASri Lankan court to deliver verdict on
OL,4,Adeadly Easter bombings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe associates and relatives of nine
OL,7,Fsuicide bombers are among those facing
OL,8,Fmore than 23,000 charges, including
OL,9,Fmurder, conspiracy to commit terrorism
OL,10,Fand possessing firearms.
